posts.text:
A striking scene outside Delaney Hall on Day 24 of the hunger/labor strike.

As roughly a dozen ICE agents emerge from the facility and line up facing protesters, one demonstrator plays a sound bowl just feet away from them. Another raises a middle finger. 

@jtcestkowski.bsky.social + Jon Farina ⬇️

